    note: `A static site of up to 100 pages starts from ${P.site} and covers most RAKEZ companies: a company profile, a structured catalogue of a few hundred products, a document library and a quote form. A large export site with market pages, a deep catalogue and heavy internal linking starts from ${P.seoSite}. If you need buyers to place real orders and pay online, that is an online store from ${P.shop}, though most RAKEZ traders should not take card payments at all and should quote instead. A distributor portal, a stock-visibility tool or anything with a login is software from ${P.software}. The claims review, the entity block, the Incoterm wording on quote forms and the performance budget are configuration and sit inside the price rather than on top of it. What moves the number is the number of distinct templates, how many products need individual pages, whether you want a full Arabic or French mirror or a focused subset, and whether we write the product copy or you supply it. Everything is quoted as itemised lines in USD, nothing is billed before you approve the quote in writing, and the general cost ladder is on <a href='/uae/website-development-cost/'>website development cost</a>.`,
