        "Free-zone suffix published, not hidden — it is normal in trade",
        "No office, factory or team claimed that you do not hold or employ",
        "One site, several brand ranges, rather than a domain per brand",
        "Anything about territory or permitted activity confirmed with the zone, not with us",
